Fix signal ring index overflow in IPCEventEmulated::streamWait.

Without the modulo, read_index walks past the end of the 32-slot signal
array after 32 uses of the same IPC event handle, causing hipErrorInvalidValue
on the 33rd import. ROCm/rocm-systems#11511 and #11749.

--- a/projects/clr/hipamd/src/hip_event_ipc.cpp
+++ b/projects/clr/hipamd/src/hip_event_ipc.cpp
@@ -96,1 +96,1 @@
-  const int offset = ipc_evt_.ipc_shmem_->read_index;
+  const int offset = ipc_evt_.ipc_shmem_->read_index % IPC_SIGNALS_PER_EVENT;
